  "details": "Reshade is already allowed but only the limited multiplayer version\n\nWhich makes sense as VRChat is a multiplayer game\n\nExcept it makes the depth buffer harder to access which makes effects like DOF, AO, etc not as usuable all the time\n\nAnd I totally get that people *could* use the depth buffer to cheat and see stuff like wireframes but you can already do that easily with avatars\n\nVRChat overall isn't a game that you can \"cheat\" as there isn't a set objective\n\nIt'd be nice to be able to make proper consistent use of the depth buffer for post processing",
